<title>UK: Drew Scientific probing cardio copportunity.</title>
<headline>Drew Scientific probing cardio copportunity.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Drew Scientific Group Plc said on Friday that it was evaluating the effectiveness of its proprietary technology on the onset of cardiovascular disease.</p>
<p>The company, whose share price rise 28-1/2 pence to 191, said it was investigating the feasibility of testing its G100 series instrumentation.</p>
<p>The company did not say how long it would take to carry out the evaluation.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4366</p>
